            "repere": "Paragraphe · BeardFlex™ fabric is soft and flexible s",
            "text": "BeardFlex™ fabric is soft and flexible so it stays on over stubble and facial hair. Apply to clean, dry skin and peel off slowly in the morning. Most men with beards have already given up on regular tape. This one doesn’t force the trade-off.",
